Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.06,0:00:04.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.18,0:00:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂塔妮亚之翼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wings of Titania,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.75,0:00:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我开启天眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}bear mine eyes aloft as I bid thee…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.18,0:00:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 巫术袋 - 所以是女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hex bag. - So we're thinking witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.61,0:00:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是古老的黑魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. This is old-world black magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.99,0:00:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是来找这个女巫的 罗威娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here for the witch. Rowena.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.34,0:00:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.91,0:00:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可抛弃了我三百年\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did manage to stay away for 300 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.11,0:00:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟大巫师团闹僵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was the unpleasantness with the Grand Coven.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.91,0:00:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种环境根本不适合带孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was no environment for a child!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.70,0:00:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他偷什么了 - 花生酱和面包\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, what did he take? - Peanut butter and bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们送我去了个男童院\N{\fnArial\fs30}They sent me to a boys' home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.86,0:00:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我教你服从纪律 承担责任 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teaches you some discipline and responsibility, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.19,0:00:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你不去惹麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep you out of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.41,0:00:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是该隐 - 该隐和亚伯那个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's cain. - As in Cain and Abel?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.26,0:00:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法要把我弟弟变作他的宠物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer was gonna make my brother into his pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.16,0:00:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我提出了协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so I offered a deal …
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.74,0:00:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是该隐的血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the bloody mark of Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.12,0:00:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我变成了地狱的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I became a soldier of hell …
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.77,0:00:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能给你那个血印 迪恩 如果你真想如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can give you the mark, Dean, if it's what you truly want.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.67,0:00:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你得清楚这个血印会给你的重担\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have to know with the mark comes a great burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.77,0:00:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么 查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell? Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.49,0:00:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的身体还有联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still connected physically.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.26,0:00:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们伤害她 也会伤到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you hurt her, you hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 丫头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.89,0:00:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原谅你了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgive you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.60,0:00:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.03,0:01:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.54,0:01:11.34,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.92,0:01:15.76,Note,0,0,0,0,,（俄勒冈州 彭德尔顿）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.04,0:01:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我啊 我没拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't me, man! I didn't take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.09,0:01:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总跑来偷我东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep on coming and stealing from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.56,0:01:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was that…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.57,0:01:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱哪去了 我的钱哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my money? Where's my money?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.13,0:01:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,把钱还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give me my money!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.10,0:01:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以我老妈起誓 JP\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swear on my mother, J.P.,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.53,0:01:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,再让我在这儿看到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see your face in here again…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.12,0:01:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.64,0:01:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.77,0:01:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是美国 你不能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is freakin' America, man. You can't just…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.86,0:01:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看什么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.19,0:02:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第10季第12集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.61,0:02:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,该隐杀了亚伯之后 他成了恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}After Cain killed Abel, he became a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.22,0:02:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从一开始就觉得我们心有灵犀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt connected to you right from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.37,0:03:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很像\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I are very much alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.69,0:03:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能给你那个血印 迪恩 如果你真想如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can give you the mark, Dean, if it's what you truly want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.26,0:03:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开杀戒是有理由的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when I kill, I kill for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.75,0:03:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和该隐没有半点相似之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm nothing like Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.77,0:03:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要抗拒自己的本性呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you fighting what you really are?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.52,0:03:32.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（激光除疤）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.62,0:04:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现桩案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caught a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.14,0:04:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么东西在劫持人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently something is taking people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.50,0:04:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,并留下他们的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}and leaving their clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.66,0:04:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,早该来个限制级的活儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}About time this gig got an "R" rating.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.80,0:04:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你去看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Why don't you check it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.08,0:04:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里留守\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll hold down the fort.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.52,0:04:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你已经一周没离开地堡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you haven't left the bunker in a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.29,0:04:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.04,0:04:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能余生都\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you can't just live the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.10,0:04:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,把自己关在这间屋子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}locked up in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.66,0:04:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 我这儿有吃的有床\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I got three hots and a cot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.93,0:04:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不错了 - 我知道你担心血印的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Could be worse. - Look, I know you're worried about the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.43,0:04:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 萨姆 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Sam. I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.59,0:04:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对查理大打出手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Between what I did to Charlie…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.63,0:04:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理原谅了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie forgave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.29,0:04:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能原谅自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you forgive yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.10,0:04:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在的记录可不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm not exactly batting 1, 000 here, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.56,0:04:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I do know that,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.41,0:04:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但关在这里 坐在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}But staying locked up in here, sitting on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.43,0:05:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,反复读同一堆传说书籍\N{\fnArial\fs30}reading the same lore books over and over and over again,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.60,0:05:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没用啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not helping you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.28,0:05:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了你自己 你得继续猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to get back in the game for your own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.00,0:05:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以战胜这个的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can beat this, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.56,0:05:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真相信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.58,0:05:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're damn right I believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.26,0:05:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你12岁之前还相信复活节兔子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you also believed in the easter bunny till you were 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.44,0:05:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,才没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.72,0:05:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那时才11\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I was 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.61,0:05:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,岁半\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a half.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.69,0:05:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,11岁半 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a half. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.00,0:05:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.72,0:05:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.34,0:05:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后…一道白光\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then… then… then there was this bright light,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.94,0:05:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 那家伙一下就没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and… bam… the dude's just gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.35,0:05:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都不剩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing left but, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.97,0:05:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一套便宜西装和男鞋吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A cheap suit and a pair of florsheims?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.38,0:05:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.89,0:06:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到别人了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.02,0:06:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir, officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.20,0:06:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那有没有觉得冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about, uh, a chill?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.59,0:06:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者闻到臭鸡蛋味儿了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or did you smell any rotten eggs?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.66,0:06:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.86,0:06:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, man. Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.54,0:06:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我闻到花香了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I smelled flowers, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.99,0:06:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,花香 什么样的花香\N{\fnArial\fs30}You smelled flowers? What kind of flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.88,0:06:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是花香\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flowery flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.24,0:06:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是花香\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flowery flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.04,0:06:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.71,0:06:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都清楚这其实是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all know what's going on here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.49,0:06:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.14,0:06:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,外星人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aliens.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.31,0:06:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.13,0:06:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.89,0:06:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人被绑架了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude was abducted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.81,0:06:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.18,0:06:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,2003年5月 那些混蛋 他们抓走了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}May 2003. Those suckers, they grabbed me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.51,0:06:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还到处捅我 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and they probed me everywhere. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.26,0:06:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多谢配合 - 真的到处都捅遍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks for your time. - Yeah. I'm talking everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.38,0:06:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到处啊 - 嗯 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I mean everywhere. - Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.13,0:06:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 简直扯得没边了 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, the wheels just came flying off the bus. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.64,0:06:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有冷点 大概不是鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}No cold spots means it probably wasn't a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.76,0:06:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有硫磺 不是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no sulfur means no demons,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.37,0:06:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that leaves us with what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.83,0:06:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个小绿人 一桶润滑油吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple of little green dudes and a bucket of lube?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.84,0:07:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者仙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or fairies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.85,0:07:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or…angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.65,0:07:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒宁可是小绿人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather have the little green dudes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.73,0:07:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去JP家翻翻看\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'll go scope out J.P.'s place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.37,0:07:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去里面打听一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, uh… you ask around inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.35,0:07:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.89,0:07:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们别分开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have to split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.58,0:07:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. It's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.59,0:07:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,问当地人几个问题我还是做得来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can handle a little 20 questions with the locals, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.46,0:07:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定吗 - 嗯 这是个酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You sure? - Yeah, hey, look, it's a dive bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.90,0:07:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会如鱼得水的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my comfort zone, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.64,0:07:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.15,0:07:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.65,0:07:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,要点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.84,0:07:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他的 我要相信自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw it. I'm gonna believe in myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.60,0:07:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,有你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attaboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.33,0:07:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我点有劲的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me something dark and strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.15,0:07:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识那个失踪的家伙 JP吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, did you know that guy that went missing… J.P.?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.88,0:08:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's asking?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.40,0:08:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是个老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just an old pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.49,0:08:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生这种事我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sorry to hear about what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.34,0:08:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但 那人就是个渣滓\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… guy's a lowlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.27,0:08:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那晚上 我把他赶了出去 因为他偷我小费\N{\fnArial\fs30}That night, I had to kick his ass out of here for stealing my tips.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.12,0:08:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管JP是遭遇了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever J.P. got…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.65,0:08:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他八成是罪有应得\N{\fnArial\fs30}probably had it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.10,0:08:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,JP也没那么糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}J.P. wasn't that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.74,0:08:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.14,0:08:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们关系没那么好 但的确认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't exactly "cheers, " but yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.18,0:08:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't get me wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.35,0:08:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不敢跟他买二手车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not buy a used car from the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.44,0:09:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他不会伤害别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he was harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.85,0:09:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他的问题在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what was his problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.16,0:09:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,多了去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What wasn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.95,0:09:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么大白天在这儿买醉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in here getting stunned while the sun's still up,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.74,0:09:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活肯定一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}your life's a regular Charlie foxtrot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.82,0:09:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.62,0:09:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.04,0:09:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tina.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.20,0:09:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢用\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.75,0:09:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道斯克兰顿的皇家旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know the royale motel in Scranton?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.33,0:09:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸 我和我弟 我们被大雪困在那儿一周\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad, me, and my bro… we got snowed in there for a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.29,0:09:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在那里待了三个多月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I was there for about three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.84,0:09:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我爸把我们的钱都喝光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}after my father drank all our money away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.56,0:09:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃白米和嘀嗒糖过活 直到被赶走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lived on white rice and tic tacs until they kicked us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.69,0:09:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好时光啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.64,0:09:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸一直在工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad was always working,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.67,0:09:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是我研究出大概101种\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I came up with about 101 different ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.44,0:09:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,做奶酪通心粉的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make macaroni and cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.04,0:09:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.64,0:09:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 加番茄酱当调味料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Now, add ketchup for spice, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.25,0:09:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,金枪鱼 热狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, tuna, hot dogs,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.86,0:09:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有混搭棉花糖\N{\fnArial\fs30}fluff marshmallow mix.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.34,0:09:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,听上去好恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh! That sounds disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.95,0:10:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弟弟还觉得挺新奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, my brother thought it was exotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.77,0:10:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬糟糕的童年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here's to, uh, crappy childhoods.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.48,0:10:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.54,0:10:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.86,0:10:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.62,0:10:21.18,Note,0,0,0,0,,（萨姆呼叫）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.94,0:10:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,免得你无可救药地爱上我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you fall hopelessly in love with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.85,0:10:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会有事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.08,0:10:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,向来都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.14,0:10:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么样 - 不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How we looking? - Not great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.94,0:10:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,JP再过三天就会被驱逐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out J.P. was about three days from getting evicted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.77,0:10:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,房东说他成天放尼尔·戴蒙德的歌曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}His landlord said the guy blasted Neil Diamond 24/7.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.25,0:10:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,还说他的厕所是\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that his bathroom was,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.82,0:10:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,「魔鬼的屁眼」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Like staring into the devil's butt."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.14,0:10:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好生动\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's vivid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.72,0:10:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且准确 我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And accurate. I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.20,0:10:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了厕所还是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw the John, or, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.87,0:10:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,少来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.56,0:10:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you got anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.49,0:10:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I got, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.66,0:11:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没发现 怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack with two scoops of squat. I don't know, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.85,0:11:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今晚就到此为止吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we ought to just call it a night and, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.64,0:11:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.30,0:11:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.56,0:11:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我好像有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, I think I got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.33,0:11:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tina?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.97,0:11:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.58,0:12:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.95,0:12:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.33,0:12:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.83,0:12:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.84,0:12:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.97,0:12:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 是我啊 蒂娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean? It's me… Tina.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.48,0:12:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.05,0:12:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你告诉我你知道这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell me you know what the hell is going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.49,0:12:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 我还不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, I'm not sure yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.99,0:12:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出了酒吧 然后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I left the bar and then there was this…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.35,0:12:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一道白光吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A light? A bright light?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.80,0:12:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 然后我就到这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, and then I was here,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.73,0:13:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为这是做恶梦 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I thought this was a nightmare, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.52,0:13:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 如果你也在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god, if you're here…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.91,0:13:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能是真的 这…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be real. This doesn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.25,0:13:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 尽量保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. Just try to stay calm, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.97,0:13:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静 我变成小孩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay calm? I'm a freakin' tween,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.11,0:13:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看上去像想进单向乐队没成功的小屁孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you look like some One Direction reject.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.46,0:13:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们在吓人的连环杀手地下室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're in some freaky serial-killer basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.53,0:13:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不能… - 蒂娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't… - Tina, Tina, just…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.50,0:13:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你有事的 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna let anything happen to you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.97,0:13:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再让你有别的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, anything else happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.77,0:13:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.14,0:13:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么这么冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you so calm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.03,0:13:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,熟能生巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.56,0:13:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那位是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.57,0:13:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.33,0:13:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.54,0:13:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,JP\N{\fnArial\fs30}J.P.?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.57,0:14:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.28,0:14:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.39,0:14:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.57,0:14:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是美国 你不能这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is freakin' America, man! You can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.47,0:14:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.59,0:14:32.48,Note,0,0,0,0,,（呼叫迪恩）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.23,0:14:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.18,0:15:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.55,0:15:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那外套哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did that Jacket come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.13,0:15:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的成人礼礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}My bar mitzvah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.26,0:15:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那晚上很神奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a magical night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.35,0:15:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.76,0:15:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you try it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.71,0:15:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,垃圾箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dumpster.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.56,0:15:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,在垃圾箱旁找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found it by the dumpster.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.94,0:15:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.29,0:15:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们大概下了毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}They probably poisoned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.73,0:15:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.24,0:15:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.56,0:15:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他们把JP怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think they're doing to J.P.?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.31,0:15:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.19,0:16:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.88,0:16:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我们弄出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting us out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.50,0:16:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, before…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.35,0:16:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你就是个普通的酒鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were just another drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.97,0:16:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更喜欢人说行为正常酗酒者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prefer functional alcoholic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.45,0:16:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, who…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.01,0:16:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.41,0:16:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这…说来话长了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That… is a long-ass story.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.41,0:17:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.71,0:17:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好嘞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yahtzee.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.63,0:18:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.11,0:18:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.72,0:18:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 我会拖住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry. I'll keep him busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.81,0:18:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 你得跟我一起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw that. You're coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.99,0:18:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了 快走吧 找人来帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no time. Go. Get help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.04,0:18:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蒂娜 - 我知道你能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tina… - I know you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.94,0:18:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! Help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.54,0:18:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.91,0:18:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a doctor now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.32,0:18:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫唤什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you screaming about, girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.20,0:18:51.22,Note,0,0,0,0,,（巫术和神秘学 蓍草）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.99,0:19:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.77,0:19:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiya, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.68,0:19:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.75,0:19:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.02,0:19:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.96,0:19:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you're a…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.76,0:19:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.89,0:19:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.95,0:19:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个疤脸 一道白光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some scarface-looking dude, bright light.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.51,0:19:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧接着 我醒来就变成比伯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next thing I know, I wake up looking like Bieber.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.88,0:19:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么有人要把你变成…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would someone turn you into…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.26,0:19:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know. Don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.55,0:19:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有手雷吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we got any grenades?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.14,0:20:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.35,0:20:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,别…等等 跟我说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't… wait, wait, wait. Wait a second. Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.09,0:20:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,非要现在吗 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, Sam? Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.29,0:20:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我毛都没长全 还有个姑娘命悬一线\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got no grass on the infield, and a girl's gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.19,0:20:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉我现在没心情聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry if I'm not in a chatty mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.93,0:20:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我继续猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you wanted me back in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.56,0:20:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要继续猎魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm back in the damn game.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.63,0:20:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.51,0:20:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,夫人 我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, allow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.11,0:20:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你儿子真有礼貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your son is so polite.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.89,0:20:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.77,0:20:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们去哪 - 路上说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are we heading? - Tell you on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.65,0:20:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.92,0:20:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 或许还是我来开吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, uh… maybe I should drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.13,0:20:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.08,0:20:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,座位 座位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Seat. Seat. Seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.46,0:21:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛋糕 他们给你蛋糕做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cake. Why would they give you cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.59,0:21:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.32,0:21:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不怎么好吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't even good cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.83,0:21:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,太干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.12,0:21:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.59,0:21:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.75,0:21:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 是有什么 这太离奇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, not nothing. Look, this is bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.54,0:21:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算对我们来说 迪恩 这真是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even for us, Dean. This is insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.03,0:21:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你差不多…多大 14岁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You… you're like… what, you're like 14?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.47,0:21:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么感觉啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does it even feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.23,0:21:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.89,0:21:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,心老体幼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm… I'm old me, but I'm a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.53,0:21:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,太奇怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's freakin' weird, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.21,0:21:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.98,0:21:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.72,0:21:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去旅馆乘坐的公交车\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a Taylor Swift song.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.91,0:22:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,播了一首泰勒·斯威夫特的歌…\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the bus that I hopped to the motel, and, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.39,0:22:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好喜欢 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I liked it, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.64,0:22:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liked it a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.11,0:22:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.95,0:22:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我声音很奇怪 有9个青春痘\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my voice is weird, and I've got like nine zits,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.82,0:22:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对这玩意毫无控制力\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I have zero control over this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.68,0:22:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,一会儿硬 一会儿软 硬得毫无理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's up. It's down. It's up for no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.42,0:22:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 多谢分享\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough. Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.65,0:22:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是青春期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh let's just call it puberty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.11,0:22:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 糟透了 又来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, which sucks. Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.25,0:22:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 我查看了你被劫走的巷子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, listen, I checked out the alley where you got jumped,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.28,0:22:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现了蓍草\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I found yarrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.26,0:22:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.05,0:22:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,意味着我们面对的可能是个女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Means we're probably dealing with a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.90,0:22:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓍草是一种花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yarrow's a flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.76,0:22:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在许多咒语里都会用到 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They use it in a ton of spells. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.51,0:22:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们后备箱里还有杀女巫的东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still got some of that witch-killing crap in the trunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.41,0:22:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.72,0:22:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们把你弄回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we'll get you changed back,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.68,0:22:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后烧死那个女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then light Sabrina's ass up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.88,0:22:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.85,0:22:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 这个嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah, about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.32,0:23:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实证明 这件怪事倒也有个好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}It turns out, this whole freak show has an upside.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.76,0:23:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,血印消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.23,0:23:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.78,0:23:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这个巫术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I figure if this hoodoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.08,0:23:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是让我回到了14岁的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}slammed me back into the body I had when I was 14…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.59,0:23:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时还没有血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't have the mark then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.21,0:23:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们逆转咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and if we reverse the spell…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.13,0:23:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那血印就会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it's gonna come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.04,0:23:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.96,0:23:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.20,0:23:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许就别变回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.93,0:23:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你是想保持这副模样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. Are you saying you want to stay like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.80,0:23:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.97,0:23:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.69,0:23:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果要在发狂的疯子禽兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's between being a psycho rage monster/borderline demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.67,0:23:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,和青少年之间选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}or a teenager, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.03,0:23:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.12,0:23:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不喜欢 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm not a fan, either, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.44,0:23:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 这样问题就解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, this is problem solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.32,0:23:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm still me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.02,0:23:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can still hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.78,0:23:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是…嫩了一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just, you know… dewier.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.09,0:23:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你说得有点道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look, y-you have a point, kind of,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.38,0:24:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 拜托…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, dude…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.40,0:24:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.91,0:24:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some good news, though…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.28,0:24:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,肝脏一干二净\N{\fnArial\fs30}Virgin liver.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.48,0:24:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们英雄完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you say when we're done doing our hero thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.08,0:24:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿她出来练练啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}we take her for a test-drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.98,0:24:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.17,0:24:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再等…7年就能喝酒了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean…you can drink again in, what, like seven years?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.12,0:24:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.97,0:24:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有点好笑 - 不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's kind of funny. That's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.65,0:24:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样嘛 有点好笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, man. It's kind of funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.39,0:24:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来有人在家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like someone's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.79,0:24:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们从地下室进去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Let's go in through the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.28,0:24:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先救出蒂娜 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get Tina out first. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.27,0:25:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还开着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still open.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.79,0:25:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tina?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.64,0:25:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.19,0:25:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我块头太大进不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I'm way too big to fit in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.14,0:25:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可是第一次这么说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}First time you ever had to say that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.28,0:25:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿童装的人还说什么大话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big talk coming from the dude wearing underoos.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.81,0:25:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 反击得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.21,0:25:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这样 你绕去后面另找进路 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here, why don't you go around back for another way in? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.88,0:27:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.72,0:27:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那女孩在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.08,0:27:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,楼上 还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upstairs. Alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.57,0:27:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你对我们做了什么 - 什么都没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did you do to us? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.82,0:27:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm no witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.30,0:27:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是为一个巫师工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just work for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.71,0:27:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕的工作 他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crappy gig. Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.67,0:27:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.42,0:27:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是全世界最糟糕的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she is the worst person in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.54,0:27:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.36,0:27:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经和她在一起数个世纪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been with her for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.69,0:27:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见过她所做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things I've seen her do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.13,0:28:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妹妹和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister and I,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.62,0:28:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她逼我们伤害别人 杀害别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}she made us hurt people, kill people,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.92,0:28:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们试图逃走时\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when we tried to escape,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.36,0:28:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,她抓住了我们 折磨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}she caught us and tortured me,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.77,0:28:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后逼我吃可怜的格莱特的心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then she made me eat poor Gretel's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.32,0:28:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 女巫 格莱特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Witch? Gretel?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.37,0:28:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你说你是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you saying that you're…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.36,0:28:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩赛尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hansel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.48,0:28:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫韩赛尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Hansel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.02,0:28:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩赛尔 还有格莱特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hansel? And … and…and Gretel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.38,0:28:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩赛尔和格莱特 那个寓言故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hansel and Gretel, like the … like the fable.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.93,0:28:34.95,Title,0,0,0,0,,《格林童话》里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Brothers Grimm?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.37,0:28:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是寓言故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't a fable.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.53,0:28:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是根据真实事件改编的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was based on a true story.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.39,0:28:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是写了个幸福结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just gave it a happy ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.14,0:28:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.64,0:28:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能解决个名人 帅极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get to barbecue a celebrity. Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.30,0:28:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀不了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.74,0:28:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们只是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just men.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.65,0:28:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可不止\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.89,0:29:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.11,0:29:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那让我帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let me help.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.20,0:29:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮忙 你安得什么心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help? What's in it for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.47,0:29:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为如果你们想要干掉那糖衣贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if you're going to fry that candy-coated bitch,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.08,0:29:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want in.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.64,0:29:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.18,0:29:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我怎么把他变回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me how to turn him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.79,0:29:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 这事不急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, it can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.65,0:29:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我怎么变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me how!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.83,0:29:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我戴着的巫术袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hex bag that I'm wearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.92,0:29:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够逆转咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will reverse the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.88,0:29:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,挤一挤 你就能变回原来的年纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Squeeze it, and you'll return to your proper age.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.66,0:29:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样 我们解决女巫 我就给你解咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we waste the witch, I give you the cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.18,0:29:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,成交吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.53,0:30:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友JP 骨头上没多少肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friend J.P. Didn't have much meat on his bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.27,0:30:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是好厨师会合理利用现有的食材\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a good cook works with the ingredients she's given.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.21,0:30:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Wunderbar.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.14,0:30:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't worry, liebchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.19,0:30:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么鲜嫩 做汤浪费了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too good for soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.53,0:30:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 好好地抹上一层辣椒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking a nice, sweet chili glaze,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.88,0:30:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在烤箱里烤上几小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}a few hours roasting in the oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.11,0:30:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘴里塞个苹果\N{\fnArial\fs30}And an apple in your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.70,0:31:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩赛尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hansel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.99,0:31:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And pals.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.81,0:31:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,走失的小羊羔啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, our lost lamb.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.31,0:31:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为我们得去找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we'd have to go looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.74,0:31:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至离开我们这个甜蜜的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe even abandon our home sweet home here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.89,0:31:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没想过你会蠢到自己回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never dreamt you'd be stupid enough to come back on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.05,0:31:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩赛尔 拿下他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hansel, take care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.43,0:31:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 他并不怎么喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's not exactly your biggest fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.34,0:31:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你不该强迫他吃掉他妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you shouldn't have made him chow down on his sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.04,0:31:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没强迫韩赛尔做过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never made Hansel do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.28,0:31:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.12,0:31:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're hunters!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.82,0:31:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.54,0:32:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 谁饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…who's hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.47,0:32:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.03,0:32:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,骨瘦如柴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. Oh, scrawny.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.66,0:32:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把你喂肥点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have to fatten you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.30,0:32:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't freakin' touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.46,0:32:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要做的可不止这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm going to do more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.34,0:32:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,小孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Children.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.40,0:32:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,多么甜美天真\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they're so sweet and innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.98,0:32:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,还很美味\N{\fnArial\fs30}And delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.89,0:32:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你等着瞧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.87,0:32:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我把他煮了 我会分你一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I cook him up, I'll give you some, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.66,0:32:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你这么喜欢孩子 为什么不去抓孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you like kids so much, why not go after kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.73,0:32:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要把他们变年轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with this whole fountain of youth?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.54,0:32:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去 如果孩子不见了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, in the olden days, if a child went missing …
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.16,0:32:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻人常会死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, the young died all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.39,0:32:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过现在 有什么安珀警报和牛奶盒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, though, with all your amber alerts and your milk cartons,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.37,0:32:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,剁碎个小屁孩 大家都怒火冲天\N{\fnArial\fs30}a person fillets one rug rat, and people get so angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.17,0:32:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我说得怪奥巴马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I blame Obama.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.08,0:33:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我就即兴发挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I improvise.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.16,0:33:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带走没人在乎的成年人 然后让他们返老还童\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take adults no one will miss and give them back their youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.77,0:33:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后油炸了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then kentucky-fry 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.52,0:33:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我能安生吃饭的唯一办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only way I can eat in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.26,0:33:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样值得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, is it worth it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.08,0:33:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,据传言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, word on the street is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.74,0:33:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,人尝起来就和鸡肉一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}people kind of taste like chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.42,0:33:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有点\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.33,0:33:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧洲的孩子更像是放养的 味道更野\N{\fnArial\fs30}European children are more, uh, free-range, gamier.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.78,0:33:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过美国的 最好吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Americans, though … ooh … they are heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.66,0:33:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,更肥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fattier.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.74,0:33:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,肉的纹理更加清晰 细嫩多汁\N{\fnArial\fs30}The meat, so finely marbled, it's almost buttery.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.92,0:33:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是吃不够啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't get enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.95,0:33:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,赞极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm. Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.82,0:33:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我才是充满敬畏\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! I am in awe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.54,0:33:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我第一次到你们国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my first visit to your country,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.62,0:33:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不得不说 上帝保佑美国\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I have to say god bless the U.S.A.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.48,0:33:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你是个游客喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so, you're a tourist.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.57,0:33:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.56,0:33:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是出差 不是度假\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's business, not pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.55,0:33:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个老朋友在惹是生非\N{\fnArial\fs30}An old friend is causing trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.93,0:33:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,大巫师团让我解决她\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Grand Coven asked me to take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.07,0:34:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的愚蠢的罗威娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor, stupid Rowena.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.63,0:34:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 罗威娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Rowena?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.89,0:34:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,红发 喜欢高级酒店\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got red hair, a thing for ritzy hotels?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.67,0:34:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.01,0:34:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧死你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you'll burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.49,0:34:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,待好了 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay down, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.86,0:34:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,转化他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn him!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.78,0:35:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.43,0:35:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.68,0:35:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.68,0:35:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,神经病一般疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like…psycho crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.58,0:36:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一直干这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you do this all the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.28,0:36:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the freakin' time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.32,0:36:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是一直都这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.30,0:36:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.10,0:36:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们能把我变回去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you turn me back?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.49,0:36:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,巫术袋烧毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hex bag went up in flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.61,0:36:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 蒂娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, Tina.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.99,0:36:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 我们也许可以逆向还原咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may be able to reverse engineer the spell, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.36,0:36:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许不必\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.24,0:36:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.05,0:36:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有三任前夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got three ex-husbands,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.77,0:36:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,五万债务\N{\fnArial\fs30}50 grand in debt,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.12,0:36:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,再就没什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not much else.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.50,0:36:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我算是个挺糟糕的成年人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was… kind of a crappy adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.50,0:36:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这次我能做得更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'll do better this time around.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.67,0:36:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这里 重新开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of town, get a fresh start.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.92,0:37:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我第二次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my second chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.45,0:37:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都想要第二次机会 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody wants a second chance, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.62,0:37:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定没问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you're gonna be all alght?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.68,0:37:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我告诉你的 向来都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I told you, I always am.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.78,0:37:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少让我们载你一程吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we at least give you a ride somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.98,0:37:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.99,0:37:30.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（俄勒冈州 彭德尔顿 大平原 大巴站）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.25,0:37:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 给你 这是我们所有的现金\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, here you go. It's all the cash we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.73,0:37:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们所做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.44,0:37:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,要平平安安的 听到没\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay safe out there, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.39,0:37:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.38,0:37:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们永远还有皇家旅馆的回忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And hey, we'll always have the Royale Motel, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.40,0:37:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.37,0:38:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,大巫师团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grand coven.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.18,0:38:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有何想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.88,0:38:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't sound good.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.61,0:38:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来像是金属发乐队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sounds like an '80s hair-metal band.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.59,0:38:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,喷很多发胶 眼影很重\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, lot of hair spray, lot of eye shadow,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.65,0:38:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,键盘吉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}lot of keytar.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.94,0:38:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No? Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.20,0:38:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 我都给你描绘出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. I'm painting a word picture here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.00,0:38:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,又回来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it back?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.84,0:38:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你要说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know what you're gonna say, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.39,0:38:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你当时很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you were in deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.21,0:38:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.21,0:38:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我 救了蒂娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved me, and you saved Tina,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.84,0:38:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了回迪恩·温切斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}and…you pulled a Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.46,0:38:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.48,0:38:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.78,0:38:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.78,0:38:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望血印消失吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I wish the mark was gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.68,0:38:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.68,0:38:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对想 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely, I do, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.75,0:38:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更想要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.47,0:38:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now here you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.28,0:39:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也没有发狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you didn't hulk out, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.19,0:39:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这样就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take the win.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.08,0:39:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于其他事\N{\fnArial\fs30}As for the rest of it …
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.87,0:39:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,血印 其他一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark, everything else…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.83,0:39:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会想到办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.76,0:39:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一向如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}We always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.43,0:39:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.08,0:39:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离开这里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.15,0:39:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来了 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm back, baby.
